  "details": "The night before yesterday, one of my friends using Open Beta became Trusted User.\nAt that time, his/her trust rank on the nameplate (shown when we opened Quick Menu) is still Known User.\nEveryone (including him/her) in the instance see he/she is Known User on nameplate so the release channel of VRChat (OpenBeta or Live) of others is not related.\nSomeone joined the instance after he/she became Trusted, but they also see his/her is shown as Known on nameplate.\nWe see his/her trust rank is Trusted on the menu (in both OB & Live) and on web.\nIt's too hard to reproduce this on Live so I didn't check if this happens on Live but at the time I became Trusted, trust rank on nameplate became Trusted immediately so I think this is a OpenBeta's bug & reported here.\nHe/she tried the following at that time:\n- Rejoinning the instance.\n- Changing Appearing as to User and back.\nHowever, the Trust rank of him/her on nameplate was not updated.",
